1
00:01:35,590 --> 00:01:39,770
[Abyss]

2
00:01:44,420 --> 00:01:45,400
Help...

3
00:01:45,780 --> 00:01:47,420
Help...

4
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,950
Help!

5
00:01:49,979 --> 00:01:51,710
Help!

6
00:01:53,789 --> 00:01:55,759
Help!

7
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,340
♪ I made a mistake ♪

8
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:06,280
♪ That no one can know ♪

9
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:11,330
♪ I prayed and I prayed ♪

10
00:02:12,140 --> 00:02:17,760
♪ But the screaming took hold ♪

11
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,640
Kid,

12
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,310
aren't you going over to take a look?

13
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:22,390
♪ I once fell into a dream ♪

14
00:02:21,230 --> 00:02:22,730
He looks bored.

15
00:02:22,750 --> 00:02:24,329
His stuff is no good.

16
00:02:24,030 --> 00:02:27,420
♪ Inside I lost my name ♪

17
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,890
Help!

18
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:32,660
♪ The sun hit my face straight ♪

19
00:02:31,930 --> 00:02:33,020
I'm begging you.

20
00:02:33,050 --> 00:02:34,079
I didn't see anything.

21
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:40,140
♪ And left me ashamed. Who is who? ♪

22
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:35,560
Please let me out!

23
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,930
I'm begging you!

24
00:02:37,329 --> 00:02:38,740
I'm begging you!

25
00:02:38,940 --> 00:02:39,730
Woof, woof.

26
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:45,340
What are you doing?

27
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,530
Let... Let go of me!

28
00:02:47,530 --> 00:02:48,750
I'm begging you!

29
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:50,190
No!

30
00:02:50,210 --> 00:02:51,400
No!

31
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:51,440
♪ Who is who? ♪

32
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:54,500
♪ Who bears deep sin still praying? ♪

33
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:56,520
♪ Who is who? ♪

34
00:02:55,790 --> 00:02:57,730
No, no, no!

35
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,520
♪ Who shuts their eyes
and begs for rights? ♪

36
00:02:57,780 --> 00:02:59,740
I'm begging you! No!

37
00:03:00,750 --> 00:03:02,560
Ask your dad for some more money tomorrow.

38
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:02,620
♪ Why is the blade red with the blood? ♪

39
00:03:03,150 --> 00:03:03,820
Didn't we...

40
00:03:03,550 --> 00:03:04,680
♪ They call it just and true ♪

41
00:03:04,860 --> 00:03:06,020
just ask him for money a few days ago?

42
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:07,620
♪ Why is the slaughter made so cold? ♪

43
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:07,340
You ate a few days ago.

44
00:03:07,340 --> 00:03:08,550
Does that mean you're not eating today?

45
00:03:08,550 --> 00:03:09,700
♪ They say it was meant to ♪

46
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,870
With the factory restructuring,

47
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:11,090
your dad must have embezzled

48
00:03:10,770 --> 00:03:12,600
♪ Why can the one who saves not save? ♪

49
00:03:11,090 --> 00:03:12,310
a few million, right?

50
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:13,960
I'm helping him spend his dirty money,

51
00:03:13,420 --> 00:03:15,410
♪ Why does the one
who fights to guard me? ♪

52
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,520
which can also help his son grow up.

53
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,910
Shouldn't he thank me?

54
00:03:16,050 --> 00:03:17,400
♪ Why did they chain your two hands? ♪

55
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:21,980
♪ Then judge what they believe? ♪

56
00:03:18,920 --> 00:03:20,370
Did you hear me?

57
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:23,500
I did.

58
00:03:23,930 --> 00:03:26,070
♪ Look, now you face the darkness ♪

59
00:03:25,730 --> 00:03:27,570
Don't kill me!

60
00:03:26,780 --> 00:03:27,660
♪ Darkness stares back at you ♪

61
00:03:28,430 --> 00:03:30,050
Time to go!

62
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,310
I'm begging you.

63
00:03:36,310 --> 00:03:37,900
Please let me go.

64
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,250
I didn't see anything.

65
00:03:39,250 --> 00:03:40,130
I won't call the police!

66
00:03:40,130 --> 00:03:41,430
I'm begging you!

67
00:03:46,410 --> 00:03:48,480
I didn't see anything!

68
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:59,320
[Episode 12]

69
00:03:59,690 --> 00:04:00,380
Got it.

70
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,500
The people from the police station

71
00:04:03,500 --> 00:04:04,580
just left his house.

72
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:06,710
He should have gotten wind of it by now.

73
00:04:07,090 --> 00:04:08,740
Then let's see

74
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,980
how he acts today.

75
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,570
What brings you two officers here?

76
00:04:14,570 --> 00:04:16,320
Manager Zhang, what a coincidence.

77
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:17,820
We just walked into the hotel,

78
00:04:17,820 --> 00:04:19,470
and you showed up right after.

79
00:04:19,470 --> 00:04:21,730
That must be destiny.

80
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:23,500
We're here to ask about

81
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,740
Sun Qiang.

82
00:04:25,420 --> 00:04:26,240
No problem.

83
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,520
Let's chat in my office.

84
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,520
This way, please.

85
00:04:59,980 --> 00:05:01,580
They really were fooling me.

86
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,810
What are you looking at?

87
00:05:10,930 --> 00:05:12,100
Let me take a look too.

88
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:13,660
Y-Y-You...

89
00:05:13,690 --> 00:05:16,060
I-I-I haven't seen you in a long time.

90
00:05:19,250 --> 00:05:20,690
Sun Qiang used to work here

91
00:05:20,690 --> 00:05:21,920
in the security department,

92
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,010
but he quit.

93
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:24,700
What happened to him this time?

94
00:05:24,700 --> 00:05:25,900
Are you close to him?

95
00:05:25,930 --> 00:05:27,570
What do you mean by close?

96
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,510
Close enough to lend him money.

97
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:31,430
How much money?

98
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:34,220
We pulled your bank statements

99
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,130
and found a transfer of 45,000

100
00:05:35,130 --> 00:05:36,800
to a specific account.

101
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,270
Besides that,

102
00:05:38,430 --> 00:05:39,630
there might be cash.

103
00:05:41,180 --> 00:05:42,150
That specific?

104
00:05:42,170 --> 00:05:43,320
Of course.

105
00:05:43,750 --> 00:05:46,409
We also compared both of your accounts.

106
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:47,730
At least 3 times,

107
00:05:47,750 --> 00:05:48,500
you withdrew

108
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:50,830
a large amount of cash
at the counter in the morning,

109
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:52,950
and he deposited almost

110
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,430
the exact same amount
in the afternoon or the next day.

111
00:05:55,430 --> 00:05:57,070
And every time you withdrew money,

112
00:05:57,070 --> 00:05:58,380
you would talk to him on the phone.

113
00:05:58,380 --> 00:06:00,690
This happened within a month
of him quitting

114
00:06:00,690 --> 00:06:02,320
to open an internet cafe.

115
00:06:03,950 --> 00:06:06,080
Also, we pulled your call records

116
00:06:06,110 --> 00:06:07,860
from the telecom department.

117
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:09,860
Before you claimed
to have lost your phone,

118
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,640
you talked to him 6 times.

119
00:06:11,670 --> 00:06:12,590
One call even

120
00:06:12,610 --> 00:06:15,440
lasted 37 minutes.

121
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:16,680
Twenty minutes later,

122
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,250
you withdrew 20,000 in cash

123
00:06:18,250 --> 00:06:19,890
from Jianghe Road Branch.

124
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,310
Well...

125
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,950
Is it illegal to lend money?

126
00:06:25,970 --> 00:06:26,920
Of course not.

127
00:06:27,050 --> 00:06:29,590
Being close to a suspect isn't illegal.

128
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:32,440
But harboring or instigating
a suspect to commit a crime...

129
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,200
is.

130
00:06:33,230 --> 00:06:34,550
Knowingly

131
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:37,290
providing financial support
for someone to commit a crime

132
00:06:37,290 --> 00:06:38,120
is illegal.

133
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:39,150
Of course,

134
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:42,090
hiring someone to commit a crime
is also illegal.

135
00:06:47,690 --> 00:06:49,880
[Incoming call: Big Red Date]

136
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:06,770
Answer it first.

137
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,560
I...

138
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:10,910
[Incoming call: Sun Qiang]

139
00:07:11,220 --> 00:07:12,330
It's not urgent.

140
00:07:12,330 --> 00:07:13,680
You go ahead, Officer Li.

141
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:14,330
Alright.

142
00:07:20,790 --> 00:07:21,470
Okay.

143
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:23,340
Thanks for your hard work.

144
00:07:31,930 --> 00:07:32,650
Alright then.

145
00:07:32,650 --> 00:07:34,190
Well, Officer Li, if there's nothing else,

146
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:35,450
-I...
-Manager Zhang.

147
00:07:35,610 --> 00:07:36,870
Answer the phone.

148
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,610
What? Are you afraid to do it?

149
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:41,430
Are you afraid we'll find out
something about you?

150
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:43,600
Wh-What am I afraid of?

151
00:07:43,630 --> 00:07:46,010
It's just that you guys are too busy.

152
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:03,480
Why did it take you so long to answer?

153
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:03,980
I just ran into...

154
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:06,420
About the money you owe me,
we can talk about it later.

155
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:07,620
I'm meeting with leaders

156
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:10,020
from the Public Security Bureau right now.

157
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:13,120
Manager Zhang.

158
00:08:13,770 --> 00:08:15,650
Did this friend of yours
who owes you money

159
00:08:15,650 --> 00:08:17,660
run into some emergency?

160
00:08:21,690 --> 00:08:23,180
Who would borrow money from others

161
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:25,310
if it wasn't an emergency?

162
00:08:26,130 --> 00:08:27,370
Sun Qiang is the same.

163
00:08:27,370 --> 00:08:29,700
He always wanted to open an internet cafe.

164
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:32,450
Yes, I did lend him money.

165
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,450
We've been colleagues for years.

166
00:08:34,549 --> 00:08:36,650
It's not strange for me
to help him out, right?

167
00:08:36,650 --> 00:08:38,110
But the moment we started talking,

168
00:08:38,110 --> 00:08:39,750
you kept mentioning

169
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:41,320
things like breaking the law,

170
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,860
and that really threw me off.

171
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:43,440
Well...

172
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:45,440
If lending money was illegal, I'm afraid

173
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,390
you'd have endless people to arrest.

174
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:48,720
How many people would be arrested
across the country every day?

175
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,480
Helping a colleague isn't strange.

176
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,620
What's strange is

177
00:08:51,620 --> 00:08:53,510
that you're not only generous,

178
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:54,740
but also so rich.

179
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:56,030
You lend money everywhere,

180
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:57,290
and the amounts aren't exactly small.

181
00:08:57,290 --> 00:08:59,150
Maybe we should quit being cops

182
00:08:59,180 --> 00:09:01,440
and become hotel managers like you.

183
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:02,770
Exactly.

184
00:09:04,050 --> 00:09:05,310
You guys...

185
00:09:09,410 --> 00:09:10,910
The fish took Xin's bait.

186
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,010
Right.

187
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:13,370
As expected.

188
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:15,200
And that bastard Zhang Chengguo

189
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,250
is still playing dumb with us.

190
00:09:17,820 --> 00:09:18,750
Mr. Li,

191
00:09:18,770 --> 00:09:20,300
if you were Zhang Chengguo,

192
00:09:20,300 --> 00:09:21,300
what would you do?

193
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:24,170
Silence them to prevent future trouble.

194
00:09:24,170 --> 00:09:25,840
Or just slip away.

195
00:09:25,860 --> 00:09:27,400
He won't run

196
00:09:27,430 --> 00:09:29,630
until he makes someone shut up forever.

197
00:09:29,950 --> 00:09:31,240
You mean

198
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:33,310
that brat Sun Qiang is in danger?

199
00:09:33,310 --> 00:09:34,000
Yes.

200
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:11,800
Did you go to Happiness Park?

201
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,290
Yes, yes, yes.

202
00:10:13,390 --> 00:10:14,620
I was just worried,

203
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:16,070
so I went to take a look.

204
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:17,890
And someone saw you, right?

205
00:10:19,330 --> 00:10:20,300
Speak!

206
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:22,340
Did anyone see you?

207
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:23,790
Yes, yes.

208
00:10:23,940 --> 00:10:25,530
But that person wasn't a cop.

209
00:10:25,530 --> 00:10:26,790
And I checked,

210
00:10:26,790 --> 00:10:28,900
there are no cameras in the park.

211
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,170
Listen to me.

212
00:10:34,990 --> 00:10:36,620
You went to Happiness Park

213
00:10:37,370 --> 00:10:39,280
just for a walk,

214
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:40,960
to look at the trees and birds.

215
00:10:41,130 --> 00:10:42,940
None of that is illegal.

216
00:10:43,090 --> 00:10:44,110
Got it?

217
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:45,970
Got it, got it.

218
00:10:46,150 --> 00:10:47,790
You just said the police went to see you.

219
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:48,720
What happened?

220
00:10:48,780 --> 00:10:50,070
Why did they look for you?

221
00:10:50,070 --> 00:10:51,070
What did they ask?

222
00:10:53,810 --> 00:10:55,020
Let's talk in person.

223
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:58,740
I've been under a lot of pressure lately.

224
00:10:59,410 --> 00:11:00,890
Let's meet tonight.

225
00:11:01,230 --> 00:11:03,460
Let's talk and figure out a plan.

226
00:11:03,700 --> 00:11:06,160
I can also pay you the balance
from last time.

227
00:11:16,090 --> 00:11:18,120
Mr. Li, where are we going now?

228
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,260
To beg someone.

229
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:21,480
Beg someone?

230
00:11:22,580 --> 00:11:23,410
Captain Fan?

231
00:11:24,820 --> 00:11:25,630
Li Cheng,

232
00:11:26,150 --> 00:11:27,800
give me an objective opinion.

233
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:29,770
Do you think I was a little out of line

234
00:11:29,770 --> 00:11:31,840
when I talked to Fan last time?

235
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:35,360
You weren't exactly polite.

236
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:37,720
I'm doomed.

237
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,890
When I see him later,

238
00:11:39,890 --> 00:11:42,650
should I bow or salute first?

239
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,610
Maybe I should bring him
a pack of cigarettes?

240
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:48,340
Forget it.

241
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,100
I'll just swallow my pride today.

242
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:52,430
For this case,

243
00:11:52,450 --> 00:11:53,670
pride means nothing.

244
00:11:53,890 --> 00:11:55,290
When we get to the office,

245
00:11:55,410 --> 00:11:56,910
take your cue from me.

246
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,170
Even if Fan Jie spits in my face,

247
00:11:59,170 --> 00:12:01,790
I'll just smile and let him do it again.

248
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,000
Han?

249
00:12:09,290 --> 00:12:10,200
Where are you?

250
00:12:10,890 --> 00:12:12,030
Keep it down.

251
00:12:16,530 --> 00:12:17,100
Damn.

252
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:19,670
I didn't know you could do this.

253
00:12:19,940 --> 00:12:21,500
This car is like people,

254
00:12:21,870 --> 00:12:23,670
always letting you down
at the worst possible moment,

255
00:12:23,670 --> 00:12:25,400
and you have to fix it yourself.

256
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,930
This piece of junk
should've been replaced long ago.

257
00:12:27,930 --> 00:12:29,640
You haven't made a dime,

258
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:31,190
yet you talk big.

259
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:32,800
It's only a matter of time.

260
00:12:35,240 --> 00:12:36,080
Didn't you tell me

261
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:37,620
to let you know when Zhang Chengguo

262
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:38,820
asks me for a deal?

263
00:12:47,130 --> 00:12:48,260
I'm telling you now.

264
00:12:48,790 --> 00:12:49,790
It's tonight.

265
00:12:50,150 --> 00:12:51,880
He asked me to go night fishing.

266
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:54,760
You agreed?

267
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,740
Of course.

268
00:12:56,180 --> 00:12:57,660
He still owes me money.

269
00:13:00,230 --> 00:13:01,630
Have you thought

270
00:13:02,250 --> 00:13:03,860
that his invitation tonight

271
00:13:04,210 --> 00:13:05,720
might not be to pay you,

272
00:13:05,750 --> 00:13:07,080
but to settle the score?

273
00:13:08,850 --> 00:13:10,280
I'm not stupid.

274
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,230
But I have to take a gamble.

275
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:16,950
Although the internet cafe is open now,

276
00:13:17,410 --> 00:13:19,580
I have no working capital.

277
00:13:20,530 --> 00:13:21,510
It won't last.

278
00:13:23,310 --> 00:13:25,570
So I have to get this money
no matter what.

279
00:13:34,380 --> 00:13:35,690
This internet cafe

280
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:38,840
is more important than your life, huh?

281
00:13:46,190 --> 00:13:47,790
I've never been...

282
00:13:48,970 --> 00:13:50,720
this close to success in my life.

283
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,890
Just one step away!

284
00:13:52,870 --> 00:13:54,460
Han, we agreed on the 50,000.

285
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:56,660
You'll definitely give it to me, right?

286
00:13:57,030 --> 00:13:57,730
I will.

287
00:13:58,460 --> 00:13:59,230
Good then.

288
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:01,540
It's about time. I'm taking off.

289
00:14:03,940 --> 00:14:04,770
Oh, right.

290
00:14:05,200 --> 00:14:06,170
My motorcycle mirror is loose.

291
00:14:06,170 --> 00:14:07,340
Lend me a wrench.

292
00:14:22,700 --> 00:14:23,650
Sun Qiang.

293
00:14:28,230 --> 00:14:30,030
I plan to sell the internet cafe.

294
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:31,750
Or rather,

295
00:14:32,390 --> 00:14:33,990
you drove me out of business.

296
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,590
Now,

297
00:14:36,450 --> 00:14:38,250
you are number one in the county.

298
00:14:44,170 --> 00:14:44,930
Han,

299
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:46,750
thanks.

300
00:15:22,410 --> 00:15:23,490
Dad,

301
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,740
are you going out?

302
00:15:32,030 --> 00:15:33,000
Fan.

303
00:15:33,180 --> 00:15:35,990
[Huangshui Public Security]

304
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:33,980
No.

305
00:15:34,940 --> 00:15:35,670
Captain Fan.

306
00:15:36,150 --> 00:15:37,530
I was a bit out of line

307
00:15:37,740 --> 00:15:38,960
last time.

308
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:41,580
Please be the bigger person

309
00:15:41,580 --> 00:15:42,910
and let it go.

310
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:44,100
Alright, cut the crap.

311
00:15:44,100 --> 00:15:45,500
[Huangshui Public Security]

312
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:47,020
Are you two sure

313
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:49,890
Zhang Chengguo will silence him?

314
00:15:49,940 --> 00:15:51,810
Sun Qiang showing up at Happiness Park

315
00:15:51,810 --> 00:15:53,700
strongly suggests

316
00:15:53,750 --> 00:15:54,770
that he's the only surviving accomplice

317
00:15:54,770 --> 00:15:55,860
who can testify against Zhang Chengguo

318
00:15:55,860 --> 00:15:57,410
for hiring a hitman.

319
00:15:57,510 --> 00:15:59,780
He's Zhang Chengguo's biggest threat
right now.

320
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:02,240
Eliminating that threat
is his only choice.

321
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:07,300
Hu Sen!

322
00:16:10,410 --> 00:16:11,530
Notify everyone in the brigade

323
00:16:11,530 --> 00:16:13,130
to meet in the conference room
in 10 minutes

324
00:16:13,130 --> 00:16:15,000
to come up with an emergency plan

325
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:15,960
for Sun Qiang and Zhang Chengguo.

326
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:16,630
Okay.

327
00:16:17,910 --> 00:16:19,320
I've given you the manpower.

328
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,930
After this case is closed,

329
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:22,960
you two

330
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:24,950
will work the night shift for a month.

331
00:16:24,950 --> 00:16:25,990
Yes, sir!

332
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:26,500
[Huangshui Public Security]

333
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:37,000
The bathroom and
the utility room are both empty.

334
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,480
We've searched his room upstairs
and the fire escape.

335
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:39,890
No one's there.

336
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:40,820
Call him.

337
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:53,130
[Sun Qiang]
[Incoming call: Li Cheng]

338
00:16:58,100 --> 00:16:59,000
[Incoming call: Big Red Date]

339
00:16:59,890 --> 00:17:00,460
Hello?

340
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:01,660
Han Pinmu is missing.

341
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:03,250
The internet cafe hasn't opened

342
00:17:03,250 --> 00:17:04,410
since this morning.

343
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:05,960
I asked around.

344
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,270
He's planning to sell the internet cafe

345
00:17:07,270 --> 00:17:07,869
and quit.

346
00:17:07,900 --> 00:17:08,700
Quit?

347
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:17,040
Sorry, the number you have dialed
is powered off.

348
00:17:18,510 --> 00:17:20,050
Han Pinmu's phone is off.

349
00:17:21,810 --> 00:17:23,619
We have to get hold of Zhang Chengguo.

350
00:17:23,619 --> 00:17:24,480
We don't have much time left.

351
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:25,180
Let's split up.

352
00:17:25,180 --> 00:17:26,240
You two go find Zhang Chengguo.

353
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,220
I'll go back to the station
to check the surveillance.

354
00:17:27,220 --> 00:17:29,150
We have to find them no matter what!

355
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:53,880
Hello, Ms. Wu.

356
00:17:55,410 --> 00:17:56,880
What's wrong now?

357
00:17:56,900 --> 00:17:59,130
These police officers
are looking for Zhang.

358
00:17:58,930 --> 00:17:59,720
[Police]

359
00:17:59,480 --> 00:18:00,290
Where is he?

360
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:02,150
He's not here.

361
00:18:02,220 --> 00:18:03,290
Where did he go?

362
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:04,940
When did he leave?

363
00:18:05,970 --> 00:18:06,800
I don't know.

364
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:07,930
Ms. Wu,

365
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:11,200
your husband is suspected of involvement
in a major criminal case.

366
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:12,850
You must cooperate with us.

367
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,210
Where exactly did he go?

368
00:18:14,310 --> 00:18:15,500
How would I know?

369
00:18:15,510 --> 00:18:16,310
He never tells me

370
00:18:16,310 --> 00:18:16,960
when he leaves

371
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,330
or when he comes back.

372
00:18:18,330 --> 00:18:19,990
What's the point of asking me?

373
00:18:22,310 --> 00:18:23,910
May we come in and take a look?

374
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,190
Come in.

375
00:18:54,210 --> 00:18:56,140
Then you must know Zhang Chengguo.

376
00:18:57,970 --> 00:19:01,580
His son's real father
is actually Li Zhengbin.

377
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:33,140
The kid is inside.

378
00:19:34,730 --> 00:19:36,700
Can I have a word with him?

379
00:19:38,090 --> 00:19:39,600
Just don't scare him.

380
00:19:54,240 --> 00:19:56,430
Did you build all these?

381
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:01,310
Nice work.

382
00:20:01,560 --> 00:20:03,960
Are you here for my dad?

383
00:20:05,900 --> 00:20:07,990
Do you know where he is?

384
00:20:10,760 --> 00:20:11,810
I don't know.

385
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:15,770
Li Cheng, come down for a sec.

386
00:20:29,770 --> 00:20:31,180
It was found in the trash.

387
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:32,620
It looks like paint,

388
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:33,850
but smells awful.

389
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:43,460
What is this?

390
00:20:46,460 --> 00:20:48,060
It's the fishing bait he mixed himself.

391
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:49,100
It's for fishing.

392
00:20:49,120 --> 00:20:50,670
I'll contact the command center right away

393
00:20:50,670 --> 00:20:52,600
to check all nearby fishing spots.

394
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:55,780
Sir!

395
00:20:59,610 --> 00:21:01,270
Are you a police officer?

396
00:21:03,470 --> 00:21:06,900
Is my dad a bad person?

397
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:10,860
If you ever get bullied again,

398
00:21:11,110 --> 00:21:12,710
remember to call the police.

399
00:21:48,240 --> 00:21:49,090
Captain Fan.

400
00:21:49,380 --> 00:21:50,200
We started investigating

401
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:51,500
right after your call.

402
00:21:51,500 --> 00:21:52,180
Look,

403
00:21:52,500 --> 00:21:54,720
there are over a dozen reservoirs
in the county—

404
00:21:52,630 --> 00:21:54,850
[Ping'an Province Police
Geographic Information System]

405
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:56,110
fish ponds, natural ponds,

406
00:21:54,960 --> 00:21:56,440
[Huangshui]
[Western Suburb Reservoir]

407
00:21:56,110 --> 00:21:57,610
irrigation reservoirs.

408
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,880
[Zhushan Reservoir]
[Xiashui Town]

409
00:21:57,610 --> 00:21:58,500
Countless.

410
00:21:57,920 --> 00:21:59,120
[Heyuan Town]
[Mount Huangguo]

411
00:21:58,500 --> 00:21:59,920
We can't confirm

412
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,900
if the three of them
went in the same direction,

413
00:22:01,900 --> 00:22:03,050
nor can we determine

414
00:22:03,050 --> 00:22:04,790
who invited whom.

415
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,250
So we can't narrow down

416
00:22:06,250 --> 00:22:07,590
whose neighborhood

417
00:22:07,590 --> 00:22:09,320
to focus our investigation on.

418
00:22:09,900 --> 00:22:11,310
We're pulling the surveillance footage

419
00:22:11,310 --> 00:22:13,460
and trying to overlay their tracks.

420
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:14,250
Just wait.

421
00:22:17,870 --> 00:22:21,660
[Ping'an Province Police
Geographic Information System]

422
00:22:35,030 --> 00:22:35,710
Cheng.

423
00:22:37,270 --> 00:22:38,030
You're here.

424
00:22:38,250 --> 00:22:38,910
Have a seat.

425
00:22:41,330 --> 00:22:42,390
Where's the money?

426
00:22:42,530 --> 00:22:43,570
What's the rush?

427
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:45,060
Fish with me for a while.

428
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:46,830
Who fishes in the middle of the night?

429
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:49,290
Give me the money,
and I'll leave right away.

430
00:22:51,150 --> 00:22:53,000
You came to fish empty-handed?

431
00:22:54,370 --> 00:22:55,750
That's not the right attitude.

432
00:22:55,750 --> 00:22:57,180
Don't play games with me.

433
00:22:57,560 --> 00:22:59,010
I did the job for you.

434
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:01,430
Don't even think about shortchanging me.

435
00:23:01,430 --> 00:23:02,260
Did the job?

436
00:23:02,880 --> 00:23:04,090
For whom?

437
00:23:04,730 --> 00:23:05,670
For me,

438
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,920
or for Han Pinmu?

439
00:23:08,060 --> 00:23:09,180
What do you mean?

440
00:23:09,270 --> 00:23:10,250
Sun Qiang,

441
00:23:10,620 --> 00:23:12,250
trying to serve two masters

442
00:23:13,090 --> 00:23:14,690
will only get you in trouble.

443
00:23:18,670 --> 00:23:20,500
Han Pinmu did come to me,

444
00:23:20,770 --> 00:23:22,350
but I didn't agree to anything.

445
00:23:22,350 --> 00:23:23,030
Is that so?

446
00:23:24,320 --> 00:23:26,260
Then why did an old cop die?

447
00:23:27,670 --> 00:23:30,000
Why didn't Li Cheng and Han Pinmu show up?

448
00:23:31,570 --> 00:23:33,110
Who tipped them off?

449
00:23:35,460 --> 00:23:36,240
Me?

450
00:23:38,050 --> 00:23:39,890
I gave you a chance.

451
00:23:40,090 --> 00:23:41,640
If you had brought your gear tonight

452
00:23:41,640 --> 00:23:43,010
to fish with me,

453
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:45,890
it would mean you still cared
about our friendship.

454
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:49,240
What a pity.

455
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,010
I...

456
00:23:55,770 --> 00:23:57,390
Why are you so greedy?

457
00:24:01,560 --> 00:24:02,340
Found it.

458
00:24:02,010 --> 00:24:02,630
[Huangshui County, Xihai City]
[Traffic Checkpoint CCTV]

459
00:24:02,670 --> 00:24:03,610
[Camera 01]

460
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:03,510
Zhang Chengguo

461
00:24:03,510 --> 00:24:05,380
left home

462
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:06,380
at 4:27 p.m.,

463
00:24:06,380 --> 00:24:07,400
took a tricycle,

464
00:24:06,450 --> 00:24:09,860
[Ping'an Province Police
Geographic Information System]

465
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:09,090
and headed west along Funing Road.

466
00:24:09,090 --> 00:24:10,880
And Sun Qiang was caught on camera

467
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:12,940
riding a motorcycle on West Renmin Road,

468
00:24:12,660 --> 00:24:14,630
[Ping'an Province Police
Geographic Information System]

469
00:24:12,980 --> 00:24:14,690
then got onto the West Outer Ring Road.

470
00:24:14,690 --> 00:24:16,680
[Yijie Convenience Store]

471
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:16,770
They both disappeared into a blind spot

472
00:24:16,770 --> 00:24:17,880
after passing the last camera

473
00:24:17,880 --> 00:24:19,410
on the West Outer Ring Road.

474
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:20,790
Pull up the map

475
00:24:20,790 --> 00:24:21,590
of the area within 20 kilometers
west of the city.

476
00:24:21,590 --> 00:24:23,650
Let's check the water distribution.

477
00:24:23,900 --> 00:24:25,250
Within 20 kilometers west of the city,

478
00:24:25,250 --> 00:24:27,330
there are 2 named reservoirs,

479
00:24:25,580 --> 00:24:27,560
[Western Suburb Reservoir]
[Zhushan Reservoir]

480
00:24:27,330 --> 00:24:29,610
plus 8 natural ponds
and abandoned fish ponds.

481
00:24:29,610 --> 00:24:31,250
Across this entire gray area,

482
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:32,400
[Zhushan Reservoir] [Mumukeng Mine]
[Moon Bay]

483
00:24:31,250 --> 00:24:32,500
the cameras on the main roads
are under maintenance.

484
00:24:32,500 --> 00:24:35,110
There are no cameras
on the side roads or smaller roads.

485
00:24:35,110 --> 00:24:36,240
As for this area,

486
00:24:36,290 --> 00:24:37,050
there are plenty of fishing spots,

487
00:24:37,050 --> 00:24:38,110
as well as several old quarry pits

488
00:24:38,110 --> 00:24:39,570
filled with water.

489
00:24:39,660 --> 00:24:41,860
Only local veteran anglers
know about them.

490
00:24:41,860 --> 00:24:44,160
The problem is,
the terrain here is difficult.

491
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,550
It's mostly hilly,

492
00:24:45,570 --> 00:24:46,380
with a complicated road network.

493
00:24:46,380 --> 00:24:47,640
Cars can't even get in.

494
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:49,000
If someone were hiding out here,

495
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:50,530
you could send in a dozen search teams

496
00:24:50,530 --> 00:24:52,330
and still not see a trace of them.

497
00:24:53,790 --> 00:24:55,240
The lab results
for the residue on the tissue

498
00:24:55,240 --> 00:24:56,570
from Zhang Chengguo's house are in.

499
00:24:56,460 --> 00:24:58,390
[Command Center]

500
00:24:57,920 --> 00:25:00,380
It contains fermented corn,
distiller's yeast,

501
00:24:58,450 --> 00:24:59,210
[Huangshui County Public Security
Forensic Science Center]

502
00:24:59,230 --> 00:25:00,110
[Evidence Examination Report]

503
00:25:00,500 --> 00:25:02,030
brown sugar, honey,

504
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:03,660
and a little garlic.

505
00:25:03,810 --> 00:25:05,310
This is a very typical recipe.

506
00:25:05,310 --> 00:25:06,030
Around here,

507
00:25:06,030 --> 00:25:08,070
it's usually a secret bait recipe

508
00:25:08,070 --> 00:25:09,240
for catching wild carp.

509
00:25:09,240 --> 00:25:10,720
There are plenty of places to catch carp.

510
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:12,550
What's the use of just knowing the recipe?

511
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:14,420
How do you narrow it down?

512
00:25:14,610 --> 00:25:15,700
Wild carp

513
00:25:15,700 --> 00:25:17,400
like to root around in the mud for food.

514
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,350
This kind of chum

515
00:25:18,350 --> 00:25:20,940
is usually used in natural ponds
that allow chumming,

516
00:25:20,940 --> 00:25:22,350
haven't been dredged for a long time,

517
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:24,560
and have thick mud on the bottom,

518
00:25:24,590 --> 00:25:25,640
or in reservoirs.

519
00:25:25,670 --> 00:25:27,670
We can rule out these fishing spots.

520
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:28,400
[Zhushan Reservoir]

521
00:25:28,610 --> 00:25:29,350
[Mumukeng Mine]

522
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:30,090
At these spots,

523
00:25:29,410 --> 00:25:30,160
[Bazikeng Mine]

524
00:25:30,120 --> 00:25:32,000
there are either only crucian carp
and silver carp,

525
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,440
or the bottom is gravel.

526
00:25:33,440 --> 00:25:35,660
And chumming isn't allowed
at these reservoirs.

527
00:25:35,660 --> 00:25:37,310
But there are at least 4 bodies of water

528
00:25:37,310 --> 00:25:38,790
we can't rule out.

529
00:25:38,790 --> 00:25:40,480
Western Suburb Reservoir, Moon Bay,

530
00:25:38,820 --> 00:25:39,630
[Western Suburb Reservoir]

531
00:25:39,880 --> 00:25:40,400
[Moon Bay]

532
00:25:40,480 --> 00:25:42,220
Heishui Pool, and Yangliu Pool.

533
00:25:40,580 --> 00:25:41,410
[Heishui Pool]

534
00:25:41,470 --> 00:25:42,120
[Yangliu Pool]

535
00:25:42,250 --> 00:25:43,660
If we check them one by one,

536
00:25:43,660 --> 00:25:45,920
we won't finish even after a whole night.

537
00:25:47,990 --> 00:25:49,980
[Ping'an Province Police
Geographic Information System]

538
00:25:48,700 --> 00:25:50,110
We've traced Han Pinmu's route.

539
00:25:50,110 --> 00:25:51,160
His Santana

540
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:53,310
merged from Min'an Road onto

541
00:25:53,310 --> 00:25:55,640
the West Outer Ring Road at 6:05 p.m.

542
00:25:55,530 --> 00:25:57,970
[Ping'an Province Police
Geographic Information System]

543
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:56,810
and disappeared at the same location

544
00:25:56,810 --> 00:25:58,810
as Zhang Chengguo and Sun Qiang did.

545
00:26:52,010 --> 00:26:53,250
Let's eat first.

546
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:55,380
Today is all about fish.

547
00:26:55,480 --> 00:26:57,680
Braised fish chunks for the boxed meal.

548
00:26:57,750 --> 00:26:58,880
Let's eat and think.

549
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:02,080
Manager Zhang?

550
00:27:02,290 --> 00:27:03,830
What brings you to our house?

551
00:27:03,830 --> 00:27:05,070
I'm here to congratulate

552
00:27:05,070 --> 00:27:06,510
Officer Li.

553
00:27:06,510 --> 00:27:08,350
Just caught from the pond.

554
00:27:08,350 --> 00:27:09,680
They were still jumping a moment ago.

555
00:27:09,680 --> 00:27:10,270
Thank you.

556
00:27:10,270 --> 00:27:10,980
It's okay.

557
00:27:11,350 --> 00:27:11,880
Eat up.

558
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:12,640
Thanks.

559
00:27:19,460 --> 00:27:20,720
Son.

560
00:27:20,770 --> 00:27:21,660
Hello, Mom.

561
00:27:22,030 --> 00:27:23,140
Do you remember that time

562
00:27:23,140 --> 00:27:26,070
Zhang Chengguo came to our house
to give us some fish?

563
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:27,550
I do.

564
00:27:27,710 --> 00:27:29,570
Didn't we braise it that very day?

565
00:27:29,700 --> 00:27:31,570
What's wrong? Craving fish?

566
00:27:32,110 --> 00:27:35,030
What time do you get off work?
I'll go buy you some fish.

567
00:27:35,030 --> 00:27:36,980
Do you know where he usually goes fishing?

568
00:27:36,980 --> 00:27:38,620
I actually do know that.

569
00:27:38,640 --> 00:27:40,240
Once, Zhang caught

570
00:27:40,260 --> 00:27:42,480
a wild carp weighing over 6 jin.

571
00:27:42,610 --> 00:27:44,070
He brought it to work to show off.

572
00:27:44,070 --> 00:27:45,070
Wang didn't believe him

573
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,420
and insisted he'd bought it.

574
00:27:46,420 --> 00:27:48,250
Mom, get to the point.

575
00:27:49,570 --> 00:27:51,720
Heishui Pool, west of the city.

576
00:27:51,850 --> 00:27:53,070
It's a natural pond.

577
00:27:53,070 --> 00:27:54,420
Zhang said the water

578
00:27:54,420 --> 00:27:57,420
-Heishui Pool. Let's go!
-is deep and the fish are big.

579
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:30,160
It was that bastard Sun Qiang

580
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:32,110
who brought you here, wasn't it?

581
00:28:33,720 --> 00:28:34,750
Come on.

582
00:28:35,250 --> 00:28:36,820
Why were you in such a hurry?

583
00:28:38,570 --> 00:28:40,470
I have terminal liver cancer.

584
00:28:40,610 --> 00:28:42,070
I only have a few days left.

585
00:28:42,750 --> 00:28:44,580
Why couldn't you just wait?

586
00:28:46,390 --> 00:28:48,070
You killed Xiaofei,

587
00:28:48,160 --> 00:28:50,090
and now you have dared to kill a cop.

588
00:28:50,200 --> 00:28:52,190
How many people are you going to kill?

589
00:28:52,190 --> 00:28:53,150
It was you,

590
00:28:53,570 --> 00:28:54,700
wasn't it?

591
00:28:55,770 --> 00:28:57,810
Even though you never admitted it,

592
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:58,770
you were

593
00:28:59,510 --> 00:29:01,000
one of those 3 brats

594
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:02,140
8 years ago,

595
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,160
right?

596
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:06,170
You son of a bitch!

597
00:29:06,240 --> 00:29:08,940
I'm going to find all of you

598
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:11,830
and kill you one by one!

599
00:29:17,330 --> 00:29:19,040
When you go to hell,

600
00:29:19,310 --> 00:29:22,040
remember to kowtow to Xiaofei!

601
00:29:56,610 --> 00:29:57,840
Everyone, walk along the side.

602
00:29:57,840 --> 00:29:59,240
Don't disturb the scene.

603
00:30:23,630 --> 00:30:25,640
If I had been a little faster,

604
00:30:26,270 --> 00:30:28,040
no one else would have died, right?

605
00:30:28,040 --> 00:30:28,870
Stop it.

606
00:30:36,700 --> 00:30:39,700
The biggest taboo in this line of work
is looking back.

607
00:30:47,190 --> 00:30:49,720
Zhao Ganzhe
didn't teach you all those skills

608
00:30:49,900 --> 00:30:52,750
so you could blame yourself.

609
00:30:54,130 --> 00:30:55,310
Do you think they would have sat still

610
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:56,860
without you?

611
00:30:57,810 --> 00:30:59,090
Do you think
they would've let their scores

612
00:30:59,090 --> 00:31:00,420
go unsettled?

613
00:31:03,410 --> 00:31:04,940
It was only a matter of time.

614
00:31:06,300 --> 00:31:07,760
On this whole chessboard,

615
00:31:08,140 --> 00:31:09,160
you and I

616
00:31:10,180 --> 00:31:11,740
were just pawns.

617
00:31:12,350 --> 00:31:13,690
Who was playing chess?

618
00:31:17,940 --> 00:31:18,960
God.

619
00:31:22,120 --> 00:31:24,340
All the previous clues are gone.

620
00:31:24,500 --> 00:31:25,480
I really don't know

621
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,160
where to start now.

622
00:31:28,570 --> 00:31:30,630
If you feel like you've hit a dead end,

623
00:31:32,560 --> 00:31:34,300
go back to square one

624
00:31:35,970 --> 00:31:37,240
and start over.

625
00:31:37,930 --> 00:31:38,780
Square one?

626
00:31:39,220 --> 00:31:39,870
Yes.

627
00:31:40,620 --> 00:31:42,560
Go through it again

628
00:31:43,180 --> 00:31:44,240
in your own way.

629
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:46,810
Don't be led astray by the paths

630
00:31:46,810 --> 00:31:47,980
we old folks took.

631
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:50,090
We probably took...

632
00:31:54,250 --> 00:31:56,650
We probably took
a lot of detours back then.

633
00:31:57,050 --> 00:31:58,370
I never thought

634
00:31:59,160 --> 00:32:01,290
I'd hear that from you.

635
00:32:05,810 --> 00:32:07,350
I'm not a god.

636
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:11,970
The case has been pending
for so many years

637
00:32:12,810 --> 00:32:14,620
that it has worn everyone out.

638
00:32:34,510 --> 00:32:35,250
Mom,

639
00:32:36,530 --> 00:32:38,870
I miss your pork ribs with rice cakes.

640
00:32:39,140 --> 00:32:40,140
And I miss you too.

641
00:32:41,710 --> 00:32:42,340
Yeah,

642
00:32:42,810 --> 00:32:43,940
I haven't eaten yet.

643
00:32:45,730 --> 00:32:46,800
I'll be right back.

644
00:32:51,250 --> 00:32:52,900
Sir, check please.

645
00:32:57,170 --> 00:32:59,320
[Incoming call: Han Pinmu]

646
00:33:05,930 --> 00:33:06,990
Han Pinmu?

647
00:33:08,710 --> 00:33:09,620
Where are you?

648
00:33:13,170 --> 00:33:14,170
Right here.

649
00:33:15,030 --> 00:33:16,160
Let's eat together.

650
00:33:30,570 --> 00:33:33,090
You should go to the police station
to turn yourself in.

651
00:33:33,090 --> 00:33:35,400
Mr. Han, you're in the wrong place.

652
00:33:35,510 --> 00:33:36,970
I'm not in the wrong place.

653
00:33:37,000 --> 00:33:38,910
I'm hungry and want to eat.

654
00:33:39,250 --> 00:33:40,670
You ordered so much food

655
00:33:40,700 --> 00:33:42,030
and didn't touch a bite.

656
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:43,220
What a waste.

657
00:34:11,510 --> 00:34:12,230
Thanks.

658
00:34:14,540 --> 00:34:15,929
You must have been exhausted yesterday.

659
00:34:15,929 --> 00:34:16,650
Yes.

660
00:34:19,730 --> 00:34:20,760
Liver cancer.

661
00:34:21,570 --> 00:34:22,500
It's terminal.

662
00:34:23,210 --> 00:34:25,139
I get tired just taking a few steps.

663
00:34:27,290 --> 00:34:29,820
We haven't found any
of your medical records.

664
00:34:32,020 --> 00:34:33,550
It runs in the family.

665
00:34:34,250 --> 00:34:37,110
Once you're diagnosed,
you're just waiting to die.

666
00:34:37,170 --> 00:34:38,370
Life

667
00:34:38,389 --> 00:34:39,989
is like playing a video game.

668
00:34:40,210 --> 00:34:41,739
Some people are high-level,

669
00:34:41,739 --> 00:34:43,469
while others have better gear.

670
00:34:44,370 --> 00:34:45,580
As for me,

671
00:34:46,400 --> 00:34:47,530
I'm about to log off.

672
00:34:47,780 --> 00:34:49,580
There's no point in treating it.

673
00:34:50,780 --> 00:34:52,730
That is why you were in a hurry

674
00:34:52,730 --> 00:34:53,840
to kill Song Laifu and Zhang Chengguo?

675
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:55,440
Afraid you'd run out of time?

676
00:35:00,130 --> 00:35:01,010
It seems the police

677
00:35:01,010 --> 00:35:03,050
haven't found any evidence at all.

678
00:35:03,970 --> 00:35:05,280
Otherwise, why would you say things

679
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:06,710
I don't understand?

680
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:07,910
What's the next step?

681
00:35:08,090 --> 00:35:09,780
Your life is counting down.

682
00:35:10,010 --> 00:35:11,120
Any regrets?

683
00:35:11,630 --> 00:35:13,010
You really get me.

684
00:35:13,710 --> 00:35:14,510
I actually do.

685
00:35:15,030 --> 00:35:17,290
Do you remember the novel Xiaofei wrote?

686
00:35:17,460 --> 00:35:20,060
That was his biggest obsession
before he died.

687
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:22,840
You are his most loyal reader.

688
00:35:23,590 --> 00:35:25,490
If you don't get to see the ending,

689
00:35:25,870 --> 00:35:27,190
I'd be very sorry.

690
00:35:27,640 --> 00:35:28,700
Will you finish it?

691
00:35:29,510 --> 00:35:30,990
I have to, even if I can't.

692
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:34,380
After all, besides me,

693
00:35:35,420 --> 00:35:36,130
no one in this world

694
00:35:36,130 --> 00:35:37,920
can finish it.

695
00:35:42,470 --> 00:35:43,650
I came here

696
00:35:43,650 --> 00:35:44,980
specifically to ask if you

697
00:35:44,980 --> 00:35:47,180
have any of Dehua's old stuff.

698
00:35:47,490 --> 00:35:49,020
I want to take another look.

699
00:35:50,050 --> 00:35:52,110
How soon can these negatives be developed?

700
00:35:52,110 --> 00:35:53,030
Normally 3 days.

701
00:35:53,030 --> 00:35:54,290
I can't wait that long.

702
00:35:54,320 --> 00:35:56,370
I'm a cop. It's for a case.

703
00:35:54,650 --> 00:35:55,470
[Police] [Li Cheng]
